  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A button that allows someone to view their own avatar with the safety features, because as a person who creates avatars I'd like to be able to see myself how many other players view my avatar so that maybe i could make improvements. I've also noticed creators are starting to make there advertising logos above avatars have an invisible shader so people with safety on see it but the wearer does not and I for one would like to know if i'm a walking billboard.",
